# Frost privileged operations. The frost CLI is never elevated as a whole;
# these two narrow helpers are the audited boundary: frost-update takes a
# verified snapshot then runs one pacman transaction; frost-snapshot takes one
# described Snapper snapshot. Password required; no NOPASSWD, no wildcards, no
# ALL command.
%wheel ALL=(root) /usr/lib/frost/frost-update
%wheel ALL=(root) /usr/lib/frost/frost-snapshot
